blender-sml-geometry-stdlib 0.1.0

Minimal, parseable subset of the OMG SysML v2 Geometry Domain Library, pinned for
the geometry binding (SCRUM-624). Derived from the standard library shipped with
sml2c 0.45.4-alpha; trimmed to the solid starter set that the pinned sml2c can
parse and that the binding maps to Blender mesh primitives.
